--[=[
	Title: Roblox Global Music Player & UI
	Description: A collapsible, draggable small UI that shows currently playing music across the map.
	Instructions for Roblox Studio:
	1. Create a RemoteEvent in ReplicatedStorage named "UpdateMusicState".
	2. Put this script into a LocalScript inside StarterPlayerScripts or StarterGui (with a ScreenGui).
]=]

